<title>USA: MedCare Technologies opens Denver program.</title>
<headline>MedCare Technologies opens Denver program.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedCare Technologies Inc said Wednesday it opened the MedCare Program in Denver in conjunction with doctors at the Denver Urology Clinic.</p>
<p>The new site is the fourth in a series of nationally planned centers for the treatment of urinary incontinence, using MedCare's non-drug, non-surgical treatment plan.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
